   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xE4;ngelsesamarb 2 Litauen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twin Prison II Lithuania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xE4;r en ut&#xF6;kning av samarbetet mellan Litauiska och Svenska f&#xE4;ngelser, med m&#xE5;ls&#xE4;ttningen att assistera den Litauiska  kommunalv&#xE5;rdsstyrelsen att anpassa f&#xE4;ngelseregler- och administration till internationell standard.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an expansion of the twinning cooperation between Lithuanian and Swedish prisons. This project is cooperaion between Marijampoles Colony of strong regime and G&#xF6;teborg Prison. The project aims to assist the Lithuanian Prison Dept to adapt the prison conditions to the required international level.</narrative>
  </description>
